%% ============================================
%% FRONTISPIECE — "全書一句話" spread built on Isaiah's own
%% designated key verse (12:2-3), the same role Acts 1:8 plays
%% in the sister volume, paired with the 66-chapter/two-volume
%% structure this book is famous for.
%% ============================================
\thispagestyle{empty}
\begin{center}
\vspace*{0.3in}

\begin{tikzpicture}
  \draw[ScriptureGold, line width=0.8pt] (-2.8,0) -- (-0.55,0);
  \fill[ScriptureGold] (0,0) circle (0.055);
  \draw[ScriptureGold, line width=0.8pt] (0.55,0) -- (2.8,0);
\end{tikzpicture}

\vspace{0.22cm}
{\Large\bfseries\color{ThroneCrimson} 全書一句話 \textperiodcentered\ The Whole Book in One Verse}

\vspace{0.30cm}
\fcolorbox{ScriptureGold}{ScriptureBg}{%
\begin{minipage}{4.6in}
\centering\vspace{0.2cm}
\normalsize\color{CommentaryBrown}
看哪！神是我的\textbf{\color{DivineRed}拯救}；我要倚靠他，並不懼怕。\\
因為主耶和華是我的力量，是我的詩歌，他也成了我的\textbf{\color{DivineRed}拯救}。\\
所以，你們必從救恩的泉源歡然取水。\\[0.5em]
\footnotesize\itshape
Behold, God is my \textbf{salvation}; I will trust, and will not be afraid;\\
for the LORD GOD is my strength and my song, and he has become my \textbf{salvation}.\\
With joy you will draw water from the wells of salvation.\\[0.4em]
\small\color{ThroneCrimson} 以賽亞書 12:2-3 \textperiodcentered\ Isaiah 12:2-3
\vspace{0.2cm}
\end{minipage}}

\vspace{0.35cm}
{\small\color{TextGray} 六十六章 \textperiodcentered\ 兩大卷 \textperiodcentered\ 一位以色列的聖者\\
\textit{Sixty-six chapters \textperiodcentered\ two volumes \textperiodcentered\ one Holy One of Israel}}

\vspace{0.30cm}
{\small
\renewcommand{\arraystretch}{1.3}
\begin{tabular}{@{}p{2.6cm}p{2.6cm}p{6.8cm}@{}}
\toprule
& \textbf{卷一 \textperiodcentered\ 審判之卷 (1-39章)} & \textbf{卷二 \textperiodcentered\ 安慰之卷 (40-66章)} \\
\midrule
基調 & 審判、控告、禍哉 & 安慰、拯救、榮耀 \\
高峰 & 6章 \textperiodcentered\ 先知蒙召的異象 & 53章 \textperiodcentered\ 受苦的僕人 \\
結尾伏筆 & 36-39章：希西家與巴比倫使者，預告被擄 & 65-66章：新天新地 \\
\bottomrule
\end{tabular}
}

\vspace{0.4cm}
\textcolor{ScriptureGold}{\rule{2.5in}{0.7pt}}
\vspace{0.3cm}

{\bfseries\color{ThroneCrimson} 讀經之鑰 \textperiodcentered\ How to Read This Book}

\vspace{0.18cm}
\begin{minipage}{4.6in}
\small\color{TextGray}
不是來讀一篇冗長的審判判決書，是來看一位聖潔的神，如何親自成為祂百姓的拯救。\\
若你讀完六十六章卻只記得「禍哉」與審判——請從頭再讀，\\
這次留意：寶座上的聖哉聖哉聖哉，與各各他上的鞭傷，本是同一位主的兩幅畫像。\\[0.5em]
\textit{\footnotesize
You are not reading a lengthy indictment — you are watching a holy God become,
Himself, His people's salvation.\\
If after sixty-six chapters you remember only judgment and woe, read it again.\\
This time notice: the Holy, Holy, Holy of the throne and the stripes of Calvary
are one Lord's two portraits.}
\end{minipage}

\vfill
{\scriptsize\color{LightGray} PubHub 三書精讀系統 \textperiodcentered\ Soli Deo Gloria}

