\footnotesize\color{TextGray}
本書逐段研讀以賽亞書六十六章，整合週四查經班（老弟兄）第一手屬靈教導、
John MacArthur 逐節解經、G. Campbell Morgan《The Analyzed Bible: Isaiah》，
並貫通摩西五經、四福音、保羅書信與啟示錄。
全書以以賽亞書 12:2-3 為總綱：
「神是我的拯救；我要倚靠他，並不懼怕……他也成了我的拯救。」\\[0.4em]
{\itshape
A study of all 66 chapters of Isaiah, integrating Elder Wong's Thursday
Bible-study teaching, John MacArthur's verse-by-verse exposition, and
G. Campbell Morgan's \textit{The Analyzed Bible: Isaiah} — framed by
Isaiah 12:2-3: "God is my salvation... he has become my salvation."}
